# openOODA x86 Backend Hostile Probe v2 — full 6,936-fixture re-run

Logline: Re-run the compile + as + ld + run probe on every `ooda/fixtures/*.oo` (n=6,936) against the post-fix `oodac_bin` and compare the silent-miscompile rate to the v1 300-fixture run-probe.

Setup: Binary `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda/oodac_bin` (rebuilt after Float real const-fold, List real lower, struct field validation, 3-arm match, generalized while, for loop, SSA Float/List/Match emitters, mem2reg + ssa_opt, per-block remap, SECRET taint, contract gate, typed error reporter, --x86-elf-pure, runtime registry consolidation). The fixture set is the same 6,936 as `/tmp/x86probe/x86.txt`. Results at `/tmp/x86probe2/{x86.txt,ssa.txt,run.txt,run_rc.txt}`.

Beats:
  1. Coverage — confirm 6,936/6,936 fixtures probed on both emit-x86 and emit-x86-ssa.
  2. Compile-side categorization — COMPILED / REFUSED / ASM-FAIL counts.
  3. Run-side silent-miscompile count — empty stdout, non-zero exit, timeout.
  4. Compare to v1 (300-fixture sample, 39.3% empty).
  5. Top 5 most-miscompiled source shapes and top 5 most-common output values.
  6. Recommended next 3 fixes.

